{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HVLjWpGQceMSevjziY9VWo","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the KIP-1312 documentation, the error code name returned when a client tries to unregister a controller ID that has no existing registration is **`CONTROLLER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the email discussions about KIP-1312 (Support unregistering controllers):\\\\n\\\\n1. **Primary source**: `/store/kips/KIP-1312/2026-05-12-mail-f884fe02638d7de53fef380a-24f3c9a1.md` - Kevin Wu states: \\\\\\\"Another way is to introduce a new CONTROLLER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED error code.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n2. **Confirmation**: `/store/kips/KIP-1312/2026-05-13-mail-bf2eb97f1e7622fe0746cec3-69f36f36.md` - José Armando García Sancio confirms: \\\\\\\"Yes, we discussed both issues offline and decided to introduce a new error for CONTROLER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED and a new unregistration controller record.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe error code was introduced as part of the discussions on KIP-1312 to provide a more specific error response compared to the generic `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED` error that was previously used.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1312/2026-05-12-mail-f884fe02638d7de53fef380a-24f3c9a1.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1312/2026-05-08-mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1312/2026-05-13-mail-bf2eb97f1e7622fe0746cec3-69f36f36.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":30.14,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":147242,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":35291,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.09572019999999999,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2068}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"34b8c77f-3e32-4205-a5d3-a32e974aa96a","uuid":"1b57557c-4b5e-4a44-bfe4-166bae51188f","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:27:14.540Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the KIP-1312 documentation, 